### Test 1: Assign Units - Assign and remove
POST {{baseUrl}}/Driver/assignUnits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignments": [
    {
      "unitId": 5001,
      "driverId": 101
    },
    {
      "unitId": 5002,
      "driverId": null
    }
  ]
}

### Test 2: Assign Units - Invalid (duplicated unit)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Driver/assignUnits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignments": [
    {
      "unitId": 5001,
      "driverId": 101
    },
    {
      "unitId": 5001,
      "driverId": 102
    }
  ]
}

### Test 3: Assign Units - Invalid (empty)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Driver/assignUnits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignments": []
}
